  "notable_quotes": [
    "BUT-26 was obtained from 2D BUT-25 by a single-crystal-to-single-crystal transformation into a 3D layer-pillared MOF.",
    "Pillar selection governs layer-pillared MOF porosity and structure: short pillars can lower porosity, while long pillars often cause interpenetration.",
    "Angular thiophene-2,5-dicarboxylate replaced formate pillars and stitched BUT-25 layers into 3D BUT-26 without disrupting the honeycomb layers."
